  "body": "<h2 id=\"venue-214\">Hynes Convention Center</h2><p>900 Boylston St, Boston, MA, US</p>\n<img alt=\"Hynes Convention Center\" src=\"/assets/summit-venue-archive/summits/22/locations/214/images/_resampled/FillWyIxNTAwIiwiMzUwIl0/hynes.jpg\" />\n<details id=\"floor_12\"><summary>Level Two</summary><p><a href=\"https://www.openstack.org/assets/summit-venue-archive/summits/22/locations/214/floors/Hynes-Level-2.png\">Open full-size floor plan</a></p><img alt=\"Hynes Convention Center — Level Two\" src=\"/assets/summit-venue-archive/summits/22/locations/214/floors/Hynes-Level-2.png\" /></details>\n<details id=\"floor_13\"><summary>Level Three</summary><p><a href=\"https://www.openstack.org/assets/summit-venue-archive/summits/22/locations/214/floors/Hynes-Level-3.png\">Open full-size floor plan</a></p><img alt=\"Hynes Convention Center — Level Three\" src=\"/assets/summit-venue-archive/summits/22/locations/214/floors/Hynes-Level-3.png\" /></details>\n<details id=\"floor_14\"><summary>Level One</summary><p><a href=\"https://www.openstack.org/assets/summit-venue-archive/summits/22/locations/214/floors/Hynes-Level-1.png\">Open full-size floor plan</a></p><img alt=\"Hynes Convention Center — Level One\" src=\"/assets/summit-venue-archive/summits/22/locations/214/floors/Hynes-Level-1.png\" /></details>\n<h2 id=\"venue-262\">Sheraton Boston Hotel</h2><p>39 Dalton St, Boston, MA, US</p>\n<img alt=\"Sheraton Boston Hotel\" src=\"/assets/summit-venue-archive/summits/22/locations/262/images/_resampled/FillWyIxNTAwIiwiMzUwIl0/she430wn-160087-Christian-Science-Center-Local-Area-at-Dusk.jpg\" />\n<details id=\"floor_15\"><summary>2nd Floor</summary><p><a href=\"https://www.openstack.org/assets/summit-venue-archive/summits/22/locations/262/floors/Sheraton-Level-2.png\">Open full-size floor plan</a></p><img alt=\"Sheraton Boston Hotel — 2nd Floor\" src=\"/assets/summit-venue-archive/summits/22/locations/262/floors/Sheraton-Level-2.png\" /></details>\n<details id=\"floor_16\"><summary>3rd Floor</summary><p><a href=\"https://www.openstack.org/assets/summit-venue-archive/summits/22/locations/262/floors/Sheraton-Level-3-REV1.png\">Open full-size floor plan</a></p><img alt=\"Sheraton Boston Hotel — 3rd Floor\" src=\"/assets/summit-venue-archive/summits/22/locations/262/floors/Sheraton-Level-3-REV1.png\" /></details>\n<details id=\"floor_19\"><summary>5th Floor</summary><p><a href=\"https://www.openstack.org/assets/summit-venue-archive/summits/22/locations/262/floors/Sheraton-Level-5.png\">Open full-size floor plan</a></p><img alt=\"Sheraton Boston Hotel — 5th Floor\" src=\"/assets/summit-venue-archive/summits/22/locations/262/floors/Sheraton-Level-5.png\" /></details>\n<h2 id=\"venue-284\">Lunch / Break Venues</h2><p>902 Boylston St, Boston, MA, US</p>\n<img alt=\"Lunch / Break Venues\" src=\"/assets/summit-venue-archive/summits/22/locations/284/images/_resampled/FillWyIxNTAwIiwiMzUwIl0/OSBOS-Map-FINAL-REV1.png\" />\n<details id=\"floor_20\"><summary>Campus Map</summary><p><a href=\"https://www.openstack.org/assets/summit-venue-archive/summits/22/locations/284/floors/Campus.png\">Open full-size floor plan</a></p><img alt=\"Lunch / Break Venues — Campus Map\" src=\"/assets/summit-venue-archive/summits/22/locations/284/floors/Campus.png\" /></details>\n<h2 id=\"venue-285\">Fenway Park</h2><p>4 Yawkey Way, Boston, MA, US</p>\n<img alt=\"Fenway Park\" src=\"/assets/summit-venue-archive/summits/22/locations/285/images/_resampled/FillWyIxNTAwIiwiMzUwIl0/all-fenway-team.jpg\" />",
